1
00:00:01,727 --> 00:00:02,627
[TAKUMI] <i>Huh?</i>

2
00:00:02,711 --> 00:00:04,337
<i>Whoa!</i>

3
00:00:04,921 --> 00:00:06,923
<i>You're telling me every</i>
<i>single one of these players</i>

4
00:00:07,007 --> 00:00:08,508
<i>is above level 200?</i>

5
00:00:08,591 --> 00:00:10,510
<i>And they're all top-ranked?!</i>

6
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:13,888
GRID: GLOBAL RANK: UNRANKED

7
00:00:13,972 --> 00:00:15,640
<i>I'm a noob, and I suck!</i>

8
00:00:16,224 --> 00:00:17,183
Oh.

9
00:00:17,517 --> 00:00:18,977
New guy's only 95?

10
00:00:19,060 --> 00:00:20,979
Is he a noob,
or does he just suck?

11
00:00:21,062 --> 00:00:23,231
[groans, cringes]

12
00:00:23,314 --> 00:00:25,650
Don't worry, Grid.
You'll make it to the top.

13
00:00:25,734 --> 00:00:27,485
-Uh?
-And I'm going to help you.

14
00:00:27,569 --> 00:00:28,820
Thanks, Macho Man!

15
00:00:28,903 --> 00:00:30,655
You know, I think I really
needed to hear that.

16
00:00:30,739 --> 00:00:32,949
Just keep a nice, tight grip
on the shield, okay?

17
00:00:33,033 --> 00:00:35,243
-Huh? [exclaims]
-And up you go!

18
00:00:35,827 --> 00:00:39,956
[screaming]

19
00:00:40,040 --> 00:00:42,042
[♪ opening theme song playing]

20
00:01:01,311 --> 00:01:05,231
OVERGEARED

21
00:02:10,505 --> 00:02:11,548
[Regas grunts]

22
00:02:11,923 --> 00:02:13,675
My time to shine!

23
00:02:13,758 --> 00:02:15,593
[screams, groans]

24
00:02:17,721 --> 00:02:20,598
[Malaxus laughing maliciously]

25
00:02:21,182 --> 00:02:23,935
Rather bold of you to throw
your lifeline to your foe!

26
00:02:24,019 --> 00:02:25,562
-[Regas grunts]
-[crashes]

27
00:02:25,645 --> 00:02:27,022
Take out the dogs!

28
00:02:27,105 --> 00:02:29,315
Do I look like
a damn pet-sitter to you?!

29
00:02:29,399 --> 00:02:30,817
[grunting]

30
00:02:30,900 --> 00:02:32,318
[panting]

31
00:02:32,402 --> 00:02:33,319
[grunts]

32
00:02:34,696 --> 00:02:35,822
[grunts]

33
00:02:37,615 --> 00:02:39,659
[grunting]

34
00:02:41,786 --> 00:02:43,246
Commendable effort,

35
00:02:43,329 --> 00:02:45,999
but no attacks
can penetrate my defenses!

36
00:02:46,082 --> 00:02:47,042
[grunts]

37
00:02:47,125 --> 00:02:48,293
Impressive speed!

38
00:02:52,714 --> 00:02:54,924
<i>Impossible!</i>
<i>I cannot predict his blows!</i>

39
00:02:55,008 --> 00:02:56,134
-[Regas grunts]
-[Malaxus groans]

40
00:02:56,718 --> 00:02:58,136
Penetrating Fist!

41
00:02:58,219 --> 00:02:59,721
[Malaxus grunting]

42
00:03:00,638 --> 00:03:03,683
You impudent little maggots!

43
00:03:05,643 --> 00:03:08,605
[grunting]

44
00:03:10,690 --> 00:03:13,234
You broke through!
Good on ya, Regas!

45
00:03:14,110 --> 00:03:15,904
[panting]

46
00:03:16,488 --> 00:03:18,073
[grunts] Don't back down!

47
00:03:18,156 --> 00:03:20,158
If we can't deal
with his protection skills,

48
00:03:20,492 --> 00:03:21,951
he'll keep regenerating HP!

49
00:03:22,035 --> 00:03:22,994
[grunting]

50
00:03:23,078 --> 00:03:25,080
[MALAXUS] A wasted effort.

51
00:03:25,163 --> 00:03:27,874
You cannot put a scratch
in my barrier.

52
00:03:27,957 --> 00:03:29,084
[gasps]

53
00:03:29,584 --> 00:03:30,877
Is that so?

54
00:03:31,252 --> 00:03:33,713
Because I just figured out
how your little cape works.

55
00:03:34,339 --> 00:03:37,258
You can't block any attacks
that catch you off-guard.

56
00:03:37,801 --> 00:03:38,760
Which means...

57
00:03:41,346 --> 00:03:42,263
[yells in pain]

58
00:03:42,764 --> 00:03:43,932
You need to focus your shield

59
00:03:44,015 --> 00:03:46,059
where you want
to block incoming attacks.

60
00:03:46,142 --> 00:03:48,311
But if I don't give you
enough time to focus...

61
00:03:48,395 --> 00:03:52,273
[Regas grunts]
Yellow Dragon Fangs!

62
00:03:52,357 --> 00:03:54,067
[Malaxus yells]

63
00:03:55,652 --> 00:03:58,029
-[smirks]
-[Pon laughs] Not bad, Regas!

64
00:03:58,113 --> 00:03:59,030
[VANTNER] Relax, bud!

65
00:03:59,614 --> 00:04:01,241
We can take it from here!

66
00:04:01,324 --> 00:04:02,283
[Malaxus groans]

67
00:04:07,872 --> 00:04:09,374
[laughs]

68
00:04:09,457 --> 00:04:10,834
[grunts]

69
00:04:10,917 --> 00:04:12,043
[grunting]

70
00:04:16,089 --> 00:04:18,216
[grunting]

71
00:04:23,596 --> 00:04:25,390
[grunting]

72
00:04:25,473 --> 00:04:26,850
[knife swishing]

73
00:04:26,933 --> 00:04:28,351
[MALAXUS] Another insect?

74
00:04:30,270 --> 00:04:32,188
[groaning]

75
00:04:33,023 --> 00:04:36,901
[growls] Nothing but
damn maggots, the lot of you!

76
00:04:39,946 --> 00:04:41,072
[gasps]

77
00:04:42,491 --> 00:04:43,950
[Laella grunts]

78
00:04:44,034 --> 00:04:45,035
[Zednos panting]

79
00:04:46,244 --> 00:04:48,204
[grunts]

80
00:04:55,128 --> 00:04:56,880
[grunts]

81
00:05:00,884 --> 00:05:03,261
[grunting]

82
00:05:11,478 --> 00:05:12,771
[MALAXUS] Fools.

83
00:05:13,355 --> 00:05:15,440
You underestimate my magic!

84
00:05:15,940 --> 00:05:18,610
Divine Punishment!

85
00:05:20,362 --> 00:05:24,532
[all screaming in pain]

86
00:05:24,616 --> 00:05:27,202
[Malaxus laughing]

87
00:05:27,285 --> 00:05:29,412
Die! Die!

88
00:05:29,996 --> 00:05:33,625
Witness the unbridled might
of Yatan!

89
00:05:33,708 --> 00:05:34,751
[Toban groans]

90
00:05:34,834 --> 00:05:37,796
[JISHUKA] I didn't come this far
just to let my comrades die.

91
00:05:37,879 --> 00:05:40,507
You're going down, <i>maldito,</i>

92
00:05:40,590 --> 00:05:43,385
even if it costs me
everything I have!

93
00:05:50,225 --> 00:05:52,852
Burn with the flames
of immortal fire!

94
00:05:55,480 --> 00:05:56,648
[grunts]

95
00:05:56,731 --> 00:05:57,857
Phoenix...

96
00:06:01,194 --> 00:06:03,905
Arrow!

97
00:06:03,988 --> 00:06:04,906
[Malaxus gasps]

98
00:06:06,408 --> 00:06:09,285
[screaming]

99
00:06:09,369 --> 00:06:11,871
[bird cries]

100
00:06:13,331 --> 00:06:14,374
[laughs]

101
00:06:14,457 --> 00:06:15,500
[gasps]

102
00:06:15,583 --> 00:06:16,751
[gasps]

103
00:06:22,424 --> 00:06:24,634
[laughs evilly]

104
00:06:24,718 --> 00:06:26,302
You maggots are finished.

105
00:06:26,386 --> 00:06:28,221
You thought you could defeat me?

106
00:06:28,304 --> 00:06:32,392
[laughing]

107
00:06:32,892 --> 00:06:34,227
Is this the end?

108
00:06:34,311 --> 00:06:39,899
[laughing]

109
00:06:39,983 --> 00:06:42,485
Hey!
You can't let Malaxative win!

110
00:06:42,569 --> 00:06:44,404
You guys are supposed to
be the strongest guild!

111
00:06:45,864 --> 00:06:47,073
<i>Whoa!</i>

112
00:06:47,157 --> 00:06:49,075
<i>My maximum mana has increased!</i>

113
00:06:49,159 --> 00:06:51,369
<i>Okay. This is my chance.</i>

114
00:06:51,453 --> 00:06:54,497
Savor your final moments!

115
00:06:55,457 --> 00:06:58,335
Serenade me with screams
as you expire!

116
00:07:00,837 --> 00:07:03,423
[♪ heroic music playing]

117
00:07:04,382 --> 00:07:05,342
[Malaxus yells]

118
00:07:06,426 --> 00:07:08,386
[yells]

119
00:07:08,470 --> 00:07:11,431
[grunting]

120
00:07:14,476 --> 00:07:17,896
[TAKUMI] I'm gonna pry that loot
from your cold, dead body!

121
00:07:20,482 --> 00:07:21,941
[yells]

122
00:07:22,025 --> 00:07:24,027
[Malaxus screams]

123
00:07:24,110 --> 00:07:25,904
[TAKUMI] <i>Pagma's Sword Dance!</i>

124
00:07:27,864 --> 00:07:31,493
[yelling]

125
00:07:31,576 --> 00:07:32,869
Satsu!

126
00:07:33,953 --> 00:07:38,583
[MALAXUS] Yatan,
how could they defeat me?!

127
00:07:42,921 --> 00:07:45,298
[GAME VOICE] <i>You are now</i>
<i>renowned as a permanent enemy</i>

128
00:07:45,382 --> 00:07:46,716
<i>of the Yatan Church.</i>

129
00:07:46,800 --> 00:07:48,468
-[all gasp]
-<i>Party leader Jishuka</i>

130
00:07:48,551 --> 00:07:51,596
<i>has received 3,820,000 gold.</i>

131
00:07:52,180 --> 00:07:53,098
<i>Items dropped,</i>

132
00:07:53,181 --> 00:07:55,475
<i>Eight Blessed Weapon</i>
<i>Enhancement Stones.</i>

133
00:07:55,558 --> 00:07:57,894
<i>Eight Blessed Armor</i>
<i>Enhancement Stones</i>,

134
00:07:57,977 --> 00:07:59,896
<i>Three Supreme Magic Stones.</i>

135
00:07:59,979 --> 00:08:01,773
<i>Malaxus's Cloak.</i>
<i>Malaxus's Mask...</i>

136
00:08:01,856 --> 00:08:03,650
[JISHUKA] <i>He's not</i>
<i>even level 100,</i>

137
00:08:03,733 --> 00:08:05,735
<i>and he beat Malaxus?</i>

138
00:08:05,819 --> 00:08:06,736
I...

139
00:08:07,779 --> 00:08:09,155
Grid, I...

140
00:08:09,948 --> 00:08:11,116
You changed the loot rule

141
00:08:11,199 --> 00:08:12,992
so that the leader
gets all the rewards?

142
00:08:13,076 --> 00:08:14,911
You dirty, sexy,
lying, sexy liar!

143
00:08:14,994 --> 00:08:15,912
Ugh.

144
00:08:16,705 --> 00:08:18,206
You have nothing to fear.

145
00:08:18,289 --> 00:08:19,874
I keep my promises.

146
00:08:20,542 --> 00:08:22,127
Grid, that was amazing!

147
00:08:22,210 --> 00:08:23,962
For someone your level,
you're a beast!

148
00:08:24,546 --> 00:08:25,964
We're all still alive
because of you!

149
00:08:26,047 --> 00:08:26,965
Yeah, thank you, man!

150
00:08:27,048 --> 00:08:29,050
You were so incredible
back there!

151
00:08:29,134 --> 00:08:31,636
Who, me? Ah, it was nothin'.

152
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:32,637
Wait, hold up.

153
00:08:32,721 --> 00:08:34,305
You assholes can't
glaze me outta this.

154
00:08:34,389 --> 00:08:35,390
Gimme my goddamn loot!

155
00:08:35,473 --> 00:08:37,517
[chuckles] You're not
just a tough contender

156
00:08:37,600 --> 00:08:39,352
on the battlefield, I see.

157
00:08:43,648 --> 00:08:45,525
[VANTNER] Juice ain't worth
the squeeze on this cape.

158
00:08:46,109 --> 00:08:47,944
"Stench of Blood"
is a shit penalty.

159
00:08:48,028 --> 00:08:50,739
And the defense sucks,
unless you were Malaxus.

160
00:08:51,364 --> 00:08:53,491
The mask seems pretty good
in comparison!

161
00:08:53,575 --> 00:08:56,077
So does this orb!
Look at the stat boosts!

162
00:08:57,203 --> 00:08:58,747
[JISHUKA] <i>Those are really good.</i>

163
00:08:58,830 --> 00:09:00,707
<i>But I'm guessing</i>
<i>he'll pick one of them.</i>

164
00:09:01,041 --> 00:09:02,917
Oh, I'm 100% takin' the cape!

165
00:09:03,501 --> 00:09:04,419
Really?

166
00:09:04,502 --> 00:09:07,130
[JISHUKA] But it's the least
valuable item of them all.

167
00:09:07,213 --> 00:09:09,007
Why would you want the cape?

168
00:09:09,090 --> 00:09:10,216
Mm.

169
00:09:10,300 --> 00:09:13,636
I, um,
just think I'd look good in it.

170
00:09:14,679 --> 00:09:15,847
[chuckles]

171
00:09:15,930 --> 00:09:19,184
You sure are a strange one,
but it's yours.

172
00:09:19,267 --> 00:09:21,353
In that case,
our guild will take the mask.

173
00:09:21,936 --> 00:09:23,396
You take the money
from the raid.

174
00:09:23,480 --> 00:09:24,522
You deserve it.

175
00:09:25,023 --> 00:09:26,900
We never would have won this
without you.

176
00:09:26,983 --> 00:09:29,027
Feeding my ego and my wallet?

177
00:09:29,110 --> 00:09:31,821
Hey, man, you killed it today!

178
00:09:31,905 --> 00:09:33,031
I'll still help you track down

179
00:09:33,114 --> 00:09:34,699
your stolen item
some other time.

180
00:09:34,783 --> 00:09:37,077
Wow, you are,
in fact, a real one.

181
00:09:37,160 --> 00:09:38,661
I promised, mate!

182
00:09:38,745 --> 00:09:41,081
My word's as solid as my fist.

183
00:09:41,164 --> 00:09:43,249
Well, <i>tchau,</i> Grid.

184
00:09:43,333 --> 00:09:44,376
And thank you!

185
00:09:48,338 --> 00:09:49,422
[sighs]

186
00:09:49,506 --> 00:09:51,424
I really liked those guys.

187
00:09:51,508 --> 00:09:53,134
I should probably
get some sleep,

188
00:09:53,218 --> 00:09:54,386
but there's this.

189
00:09:55,095 --> 00:09:56,513
When I see an unplumbed cave,

190
00:09:56,596 --> 00:09:58,139
I got no choice
but to be the plumber.

191
00:09:58,223 --> 00:09:59,474
Let's-a-go.

192
00:10:01,393 --> 00:10:03,853
[SAKAEDA] High Priest Malaxus
has been defeated.

193
00:10:03,937 --> 00:10:06,189
His death will undoubtedly
weaken the influence

194
00:10:06,272 --> 00:10:08,233
and power of the Yatan Church.

195
00:10:08,316 --> 00:10:09,484
[HINAKO] Agreed.

196
00:10:09,567 --> 00:10:12,070
It seemed like everyone
was doing a Yatan quest.

197
00:10:12,153 --> 00:10:14,531
Now we're seeing
an exodus away from them.

198
00:10:14,614 --> 00:10:16,658
Of all the events
since the game's release,

199
00:10:16,741 --> 00:10:17,867
this war is the largest.

200
00:10:18,660 --> 00:10:20,954
To think it would end
because of an unranked player

201
00:10:21,037 --> 00:10:21,996
is absurd.

202
00:10:24,124 --> 00:10:25,417
He's unpredictable,

203
00:10:25,542 --> 00:10:28,294
and he continues to exceed
our expectations in every way.

204
00:10:29,212 --> 00:10:30,422
And yet,

205
00:10:30,505 --> 00:10:33,466
it'll take far more than that
to break the curse of Yatan.

206
00:10:33,550 --> 00:10:35,051
[both gasp]

207
00:10:35,135 --> 00:10:37,762
[♪ ominous music playing]

208
00:10:37,846 --> 00:10:39,097
[CASSUS] This is...

209
00:10:41,266 --> 00:10:44,019
[ISABEL] A curse from Yatan?

210
00:10:48,148 --> 00:10:50,191
[♪ gentle music playing]

211
00:10:50,775 --> 00:10:52,152
[DORAN] Lady Irene.

212
00:10:52,652 --> 00:10:54,070
Lady Irene.

213
00:10:56,656 --> 00:10:58,116
Open your eyes.

214
00:10:58,199 --> 00:10:59,868
The time has come to act.

215
00:10:59,951 --> 00:11:01,036
[Irene groans]

216
00:11:01,828 --> 00:11:02,871
[gasps]

217
00:11:02,954 --> 00:11:03,872
Doran.

218
00:11:04,998 --> 00:11:06,708
Do you remember
the man I spoke of,

219
00:11:06,791 --> 00:11:08,585
just before I joined the stars?

220
00:11:09,836 --> 00:11:11,588
That man is here now.

221
00:11:12,213 --> 00:11:14,632
And he couldn't have arrived
at a better time.

222
00:11:15,759 --> 00:11:17,010
Go to him, my lady.

223
00:11:17,093 --> 00:11:18,762
He will know the ring.

224
00:11:27,145 --> 00:11:29,856
[TAKUMI] <i>Oh, I thought</i>
<i>I recognized this before.</i>

225
00:11:29,939 --> 00:11:31,524
<i>This is Doran's badass ring.</i>

226
00:11:31,608 --> 00:11:33,485
[groans, gasps]

227
00:11:34,194 --> 00:11:35,111
[knife swishes]

228
00:11:40,033 --> 00:11:41,159
Lady Irene.

229
00:11:41,242 --> 00:11:42,702
Seems we meet again.

230
00:11:42,786 --> 00:11:44,371
I know you.

231
00:11:44,454 --> 00:11:47,457
You're Grid, the one who crafted
us the Sword of Transcendence.

232
00:11:48,041 --> 00:11:49,459
I was hoping
I would find some kinda

233
00:11:49,542 --> 00:11:51,920
secret cave treasure in here,
but instead, I found you.

234
00:11:52,629 --> 00:11:55,382
[GAME VOICE] <i>Quest, "Escort</i>
<i>the Noblewoman (Rank A)..."</i>

235
00:11:55,465 --> 00:11:58,259
[TAKUMI] <i>She was going to</i>
<i>be sacrificed to Yatan again?</i>

236
00:11:58,343 --> 00:11:59,844
<i>Come on, devs.</i>

237
00:11:59,928 --> 00:12:02,681
[gasps] <i>Oh my God,</i>
<i>Doran's Ring is the reward?</i>

238
00:12:02,764 --> 00:12:04,683
<i>The item</i>
<i>that symbolizes his last wishes</i>

239
00:12:04,766 --> 00:12:06,351
<i>and undying fealty?</i>

240
00:12:06,434 --> 00:12:09,312
<i>Oh, Imma hawk</i>
<i>that shit immediately.</i>

241
00:12:09,396 --> 00:12:12,691
<i>Plus, if I can max out</i>
<i>my relationship with Lady Irene,</i>

242
00:12:12,774 --> 00:12:16,152
<i>I bet it'll probably</i>
<i>trigger a special event!</i>

243
00:12:16,236 --> 00:12:17,612
-[CULTIST 1] That's the heretic!
-[gasps]

244
00:12:17,696 --> 00:12:19,739
[CULTIST 2]
He killed High Priest Malaxus!

245
00:12:19,823 --> 00:12:20,865
[CULTIST 3]
Don't let him leave alive!

246
00:12:20,949 --> 00:12:22,951
Come on, Irene. Your carriage.

247
00:12:23,034 --> 00:12:24,160
Ah!

248
00:12:24,994 --> 00:12:26,955
Hang tight,
we're skippin' the cutscene!

249
00:12:27,038 --> 00:12:29,249
Got me some Fast Reflexes!

250
00:12:29,332 --> 00:12:32,043
[cultists gasp, groan]

251
00:12:32,127 --> 00:12:34,295
[TAKUMI] <i>If I do max out</i>
<i>my relationship with her,</i>

252
00:12:34,379 --> 00:12:37,340
<i>not only will I get the ring,</i>
<i>but I can marry her too!</i>

253
00:12:37,799 --> 00:12:39,134
<i>She owns this territory,</i>

254
00:12:39,217 --> 00:12:41,678
<i>so as her husband,</i>
<i>I shall be lord of the realm!</i>

255
00:12:41,761 --> 00:12:43,013
<i>And get the tax money!</i>

256
00:12:43,096 --> 00:12:44,973
<i>Hmm. It's good to have land.</i>

257
00:12:45,056 --> 00:12:46,683
<i>Make way for love!</i>

258
00:12:46,766 --> 00:12:48,643
-Blade Wind!
-[cultists groan]

259
00:12:53,690 --> 00:12:57,027
I must ask, how did you
become so impossibly strong?

260
00:12:57,110 --> 00:12:58,236
You're only a blacksmith.

261
00:12:58,653 --> 00:13:00,905
Well, girl,
to make a long story short,

262
00:13:00,989 --> 00:13:02,782
it's all thanks to my gear.

263
00:13:04,492 --> 00:13:05,493
[PHOENIX] Lady Irene!

264
00:13:06,077 --> 00:13:08,038
Thank the heavens you're safe!

265
00:13:09,122 --> 00:13:10,206
Thank you, sir.

266
00:13:10,290 --> 00:13:12,375
We shall never forget
your heroism.

267
00:13:13,335 --> 00:13:14,711
Yes, thank you.

268
00:13:14,794 --> 00:13:17,213
The entirety of Winston
is in your debt.

269
00:13:18,089 --> 00:13:19,215
[GAME VOICE] <i>Quest clear.</i>

270
00:13:19,299 --> 00:13:22,427
<i>Your relationship</i>
<i>with Lady Irene has maxed out.</i>

271
00:13:22,510 --> 00:13:24,763
[TAKUMI] <i>I couldn't save her</i>
<i>the first time we met.</i>

272
00:13:25,430 --> 00:13:27,724
<i>I guess I might have changed</i>
<i>a little since then.</i>

273
00:13:27,807 --> 00:13:31,394
This ring I hold once belonged
to a man who saved my life.

274
00:13:31,478 --> 00:13:32,979
Take good care of it.

275
00:13:34,022 --> 00:13:35,690
Oh. I intend to.

276
00:13:35,774 --> 00:13:37,025
Uh.

277
00:13:37,901 --> 00:13:39,152
DORAN'S RING
IS NOW BOUND TO YOUR ACCOUNT.

278
00:13:39,235 --> 00:13:41,780
<i>The ring is account-bound?!</i>

279
00:13:41,863 --> 00:13:44,366
<i>But I was gonna sell it</i>
<i>and buy a yacht or somethin'!</i>

280
00:13:44,949 --> 00:13:47,077
Please promise
you'll return to me.

281
00:13:47,577 --> 00:13:48,745
[Takumi sighs]

282
00:13:48,828 --> 00:13:49,788
'Kay.

283
00:13:58,171 --> 00:14:00,840
[SEIRA] Hey, this place
looks really expensive.

284
00:14:00,924 --> 00:14:02,550
Are you sure you can afford it?

285
00:14:02,634 --> 00:14:03,635
[TAKUMI] Yes!

286
00:14:03,718 --> 00:14:06,137
I'm about to get another
big-ass payout from the game.

287
00:14:06,596 --> 00:14:07,514
Don't worry about it.

288
00:14:07,597 --> 00:14:08,973
I'll bring Mom and Dad
here soon.

289
00:14:09,057 --> 00:14:10,475
Right this way.

290
00:14:11,267 --> 00:14:12,310
[YURA] Uh.

291
00:14:12,394 --> 00:14:14,062
<i>The guy from the temple.</i>

292
00:14:18,483 --> 00:14:20,819
<i>I can't believe</i>
<i>I'm staring at him in real life.</i>

293
00:14:20,902 --> 00:14:22,278
I WANT YOU
TO LOOK INTO THIS MAN.

294
00:14:23,154 --> 00:14:25,699
Mmm! Gotta savor this!

295
00:14:26,282 --> 00:14:27,325
[chuckles]

296
00:14:27,409 --> 00:14:28,326
You take your time.

297
00:14:28,410 --> 00:14:29,327
-[cell phone buzzing]
-Uh?

298
00:14:30,120 --> 00:14:31,037
ARISA
IT'S BEEN SO LONG.

299
00:14:31,121 --> 00:14:32,038
[gasps] <i>Arisa?</i>

300
00:14:32,122 --> 00:14:33,456
♪

301
00:14:35,250 --> 00:14:36,793
<i>It can't be.</i>

302
00:14:36,876 --> 00:14:38,253
<i>My first love?</i>

303
00:14:38,920 --> 00:14:41,381
Seira! Hurry up!
Why do you eat so slow?!

304
00:14:41,464 --> 00:14:42,465
[SEIRA] What?!

305
00:14:43,091 --> 00:14:44,884
[indistinct chatter]

306
00:14:51,683 --> 00:14:53,018
[TAKUMI]
<i>Is this actually happening?</i>

307
00:14:53,560 --> 00:14:54,769
So, Takumi,

308
00:14:54,853 --> 00:14:56,563
you seem different
than I remember.

309
00:14:57,230 --> 00:14:59,024
Oh? Do I now?

310
00:14:59,733 --> 00:15:01,526
<i>God, she's beautiful!</i>

311
00:15:01,609 --> 00:15:04,070
<i>I need to stop being a bitch</i>
<i>and tell her how I feel.</i>

312
00:15:06,823 --> 00:15:08,658
I like your hair
and your clothes.

313
00:15:08,742 --> 00:15:09,659
You look great!

314
00:15:11,161 --> 00:15:12,620
Oh, yeah? You think so?

315
00:15:12,704 --> 00:15:13,997
<i>I'd better.</i>

316
00:15:14,080 --> 00:15:16,499
<i>I shelled out 120K</i>
<i>for this suit and this haircut.</i>

317
00:15:16,583 --> 00:15:18,126
[ARISA] So what do you do?
Do you work

318
00:15:18,209 --> 00:15:19,544
-for some big company?
-Huh?

319
00:15:20,003 --> 00:15:22,339
You were such a hard worker
back in high school.

320
00:15:22,422 --> 00:15:24,299
Was I? I don't really...

321
00:15:24,883 --> 00:15:25,884
Oh, in a good way.

322
00:15:25,967 --> 00:15:27,469
I always liked that about you.

323
00:15:27,552 --> 00:15:28,511
[gasps]

324
00:15:30,972 --> 00:15:32,140
[gasps]

325
00:15:32,474 --> 00:15:33,892
-I...
-Hmm?

326
00:15:34,976 --> 00:15:37,103
Arisa, I really like you.

327
00:15:37,187 --> 00:15:38,188
And I always have.

328
00:15:38,980 --> 00:15:39,981
Takumi.

329
00:15:41,900 --> 00:15:43,735
[gasps] Listen, I--

330
00:15:43,818 --> 00:15:45,653
I'm gonna go touch up my makeup.

331
00:15:45,737 --> 00:15:47,405
Oh. Okay.

332
00:15:49,616 --> 00:15:51,993
<i>Whoa. I might actually</i>
<i>get to date her.</i>

333
00:15:52,660 --> 00:15:55,205
<i>Imma go to the bathroom,</i>
<i>check if I'm sweating too much.</i>

334
00:15:55,288 --> 00:15:57,040
<i>I gotta make sure</i>
<i>this moment is perfect.</i>

335
00:15:57,123 --> 00:15:59,167
[ARISA] Oh my God,
this guy sucks! [laughs]

336
00:15:59,751 --> 00:16:02,671
I told him he looked good
in his discount grandpa clothes,

337
00:16:02,754 --> 00:16:04,255
and he goes, "Do I now?"

338
00:16:04,339 --> 00:16:06,800
[laughs] Like, dude,
you are so lame!

339
00:16:06,883 --> 00:16:08,218
Oh, and get this.

340
00:16:08,301 --> 00:16:10,679
This loser tells me he likes me.

341
00:16:10,762 --> 00:16:12,430
I think he was gonna ask me out.

342
00:16:13,181 --> 00:16:15,100
No, but for real,
I can totally talk him

343
00:16:15,183 --> 00:16:16,476
into going to the reunion
with me.

344
00:16:17,060 --> 00:16:19,688
Go ahead and tell the guys
I'm gonna win that bet!

345
00:16:22,649 --> 00:16:25,360
[TAKUMI] <i>I really thought</i>
<i>I had changed since high school.</i>

346
00:16:26,486 --> 00:16:30,990
<i>But even if I make money</i>
<i>or buy expensive clothes,</i>

347
00:16:31,074 --> 00:16:32,450
<i>it doesn't matter.</i>

348
00:16:33,535 --> 00:16:34,953
<i>None of it matters.</i>

349
00:16:35,662 --> 00:16:39,708
<i>In the end, I'm still just</i>
<i>a worthless piece of shit.</i>

350
00:16:40,750 --> 00:16:41,876
<i>I have to work.</i>

351
00:16:43,044 --> 00:16:45,255
<i>I need to pay off</i>
<i>my family's debt.</i>

352
00:16:46,756 --> 00:16:48,299
<i>But when it comes down to it,</i>

353
00:16:49,134 --> 00:16:50,844
<i>is money all I need?</i>

354
00:16:54,097 --> 00:16:56,349
We all talked it over,
the entire guild.

355
00:16:56,808 --> 00:16:59,477
And we want to officially
invite you to join Tzedakah.

356
00:16:59,561 --> 00:17:01,563
-What?
-[JISHUKA] Please, Grid,

357
00:17:01,646 --> 00:17:03,606
we need your unique
set of skills.

358
00:17:04,149 --> 00:17:05,942
While I appreciate the offer,

359
00:17:06,359 --> 00:17:07,777
you're not taking the forge.

360
00:17:08,278 --> 00:17:10,447
I can't give this place up.
It's all I got.

361
00:17:11,031 --> 00:17:11,948
[JISHUKA] That's fine.

362
00:17:12,991 --> 00:17:14,868
We need you, not your forge.

363
00:17:16,661 --> 00:17:18,997
[TAKUMI] <i>If I can sell the gear</i>
<i>I make to the guild members.</i>

364
00:17:19,080 --> 00:17:20,540
<i>I'll get rich and famous.</i>

365
00:17:20,623 --> 00:17:22,751
<i>Then Arisa will know</i>
<i>she was wrong.</i>

366
00:17:23,585 --> 00:17:24,961
Fine, I'm in.

367
00:17:25,462 --> 00:17:26,379
Guild me up!

368
00:17:27,172 --> 00:17:28,298
-[all exclaim excitedly]
-Thank you.

369
00:17:28,381 --> 00:17:30,633
We've been looking
for you for a long time.

370
00:17:30,717 --> 00:17:34,346
[TAKUMI] 'Kay then. Who's first
in line for some OP MF gear?

371
00:17:34,429 --> 00:17:36,431
We'd like a spear for Pon
to start with.

372
00:17:36,931 --> 00:17:38,141
He carries the front.

373
00:17:38,224 --> 00:17:40,810
Then, when you're done,
craft something for me.

374
00:17:40,894 --> 00:17:43,104
[TAKUMI]
<i>I will craft anything for you.</i>

375
00:17:43,188 --> 00:17:44,147
<i>Wait, no!</i>

376
00:17:44,230 --> 00:17:46,775
<i>Close your ears</i>
<i>to the sirens' call, Odysseus!</i>

377
00:17:46,858 --> 00:17:48,526
[MAN]
Looks like Tzedakah recruited

378
00:17:48,610 --> 00:17:50,779
one of <i>Satisfy's</i>
best blacksmiths.

379
00:17:50,862 --> 00:17:53,740
Must be trying to up their game
after beating Malaxus.

380
00:17:54,574 --> 00:17:55,533
[sighs]

381
00:17:55,617 --> 00:17:57,577
<i>We have territory here in Federo</i>

382
00:17:57,660 --> 00:17:59,162
<i>and in southern Eternal,</i>

383
00:17:59,245 --> 00:18:01,164
<i>but we need a blacksmith,</i>

384
00:18:01,247 --> 00:18:04,209
<i>and the top one,</i>
<i>Panmir, refuses to bite.</i>

385
00:18:04,793 --> 00:18:06,920
Tzedakah's new member
is our best option.

386
00:18:07,504 --> 00:18:09,756
We'll make their blacksmith
join the Giant Guild.

387
00:18:12,342 --> 00:18:14,719
[JISHUKA] We're not leaving
until we find Grid's shield!

388
00:18:14,803 --> 00:18:16,304
Let's go all out!

389
00:18:20,308 --> 00:18:21,267
[TAKUMI] <i>Well,</i>

390
00:18:21,351 --> 00:18:24,771
<i>the grind don't stop</i>
<i>when you get your heart broken.</i>

391
00:18:27,440 --> 00:18:29,651
Yo! You are lookin' good, girl!

392
00:18:29,734 --> 00:18:32,529
Much prettier than
that triflin'-ass ho, Arisa.

393
00:18:32,946 --> 00:18:34,239
Uh? Huh?

394
00:18:34,322 --> 00:18:35,699
Huh?!

395
00:18:36,282 --> 00:18:38,243
Hey! Chris from the Giant Guild

396
00:18:38,326 --> 00:18:39,911
wants to have a little chat
with you.

397
00:18:39,994 --> 00:18:41,746
You're comin' with us, bro.

398
00:18:41,830 --> 00:18:42,914
[♪ tense music playing]

399
00:18:42,997 --> 00:18:44,541
[TAKUMI] Are you shitting me?

400
00:18:44,624 --> 00:18:46,126
[MAN 1] What? Try again.

401
00:18:46,793 --> 00:18:48,336
You can bitch
and moan all you want,

402
00:18:48,420 --> 00:18:49,796
but if you resist
the Giant Guild--

403
00:18:49,879 --> 00:18:52,173
[TAKUMI] Do you know
how many goddamn hours

404
00:18:52,257 --> 00:18:53,508
I spent pounding that shit?

405
00:18:53,591 --> 00:18:55,343
[GAME VOICE] <i>The Blacksmith's</i>
<i>Wrath has activated.</i>

406
00:18:55,427 --> 00:18:57,345
[groans]

407
00:18:57,429 --> 00:18:58,847
[coughs raggedly]

408
00:18:59,889 --> 00:19:01,391
[MAN 2]
Huh? What the hell, dude?

409
00:19:01,474 --> 00:19:03,560
You can't just gank people.
You're gonna get banned!

410
00:19:03,643 --> 00:19:04,936
-[TAKUMI] I don't care!
-[both gasp]

411
00:19:05,603 --> 00:19:07,897
Nobody gets between me
and my money!

412
00:19:07,981 --> 00:19:08,940
[both gasp]

413
00:19:09,607 --> 00:19:12,152
Unyielding Justice!

414
00:19:12,694 --> 00:19:13,987
PSYCHOPATH APPEARS IN SATISFY!

415
00:19:14,070 --> 00:19:15,739
Thanks to one courageous user,

416
00:19:15,822 --> 00:19:17,907
we have the footage
from the scene of the crime.

417
00:19:18,491 --> 00:19:20,535
Now, a warning.
This video is shocking.

418
00:19:20,618 --> 00:19:22,871
So viewer discretion
is strongly advised.

419
00:19:22,954 --> 00:19:24,914
[grunting]

420
00:19:24,998 --> 00:19:26,332
[TV HOST] <i>Debate is spreading</i>
<i>about how to deal</i>

421
00:19:26,416 --> 00:19:27,792
<i>with in-game psychopaths.</i>

422
00:19:28,460 --> 00:19:30,211
<i>Players, stay safe out there.</i>

423
00:19:30,295 --> 00:19:31,254
[Chris grunts]

424
00:19:32,630 --> 00:19:35,133
You're gonna pay
for what you've done, Tzedakah.

425
00:19:35,592 --> 00:19:37,010
Mark my words.

426
00:19:38,428 --> 00:19:40,764
[JISHUKA] Hey,
how long are you going to sleep?

427
00:19:41,348 --> 00:19:42,974
Grid! Hello?

428
00:19:43,058 --> 00:19:44,142
Wake up!

429
00:19:44,476 --> 00:19:46,269
Any updates on our new gear?

430
00:19:47,479 --> 00:19:50,231
[Takumi groaning]

431
00:19:52,233 --> 00:19:54,527
I managed to finish it, somehow.

432
00:19:54,903 --> 00:19:56,071
<i>É sério?</i>

433
00:19:56,154 --> 00:19:57,113
You still got it done

434
00:19:57,197 --> 00:19:59,157
even after what happened
with that Giant Guild?

435
00:19:59,240 --> 00:20:02,702
Yeah. The whole world does think
I'm a raging psychopath now.

436
00:20:03,370 --> 00:20:05,163
But I put my rage into my art.

437
00:20:05,246 --> 00:20:07,207
So who needs therapy,
am I right?

438
00:20:07,957 --> 00:20:09,626
Whoa, no way.

439
00:20:09,709 --> 00:20:10,919
Yes way!

440
00:20:11,002 --> 00:20:12,671
What's your preferred payment,
cash or card?

441
00:20:13,963 --> 00:20:16,716
All right.
How does 800,000 gold sound?

442
00:20:17,300 --> 00:20:19,135
[TAKUMI] <i>800,000?</i>

443
00:20:19,219 --> 00:20:21,012
<i>That's 96 million yen!</i>

444
00:20:21,596 --> 00:20:23,390
<i>When I crafted</i>
<i>the Sword of Transcendence</i>

445
00:20:23,473 --> 00:20:26,559
<i>for Uncle Moneystache,</i>
<i>I only got 220K!</i>

446
00:20:26,643 --> 00:20:29,229
<i>Yes, overpay me,</i>
<i>you witless little lambs.</i>

447
00:20:29,813 --> 00:20:31,773
How come Pon's
the only one who gets one?

448
00:20:31,856 --> 00:20:33,149
That thing's gotta be fake!

449
00:20:33,233 --> 00:20:34,359
Throw that piece of shit out!

450
00:20:34,442 --> 00:20:35,360
[TAKUMI] Ladies, please,

451
00:20:35,443 --> 00:20:36,861
there's enough gear
to go around.

452
00:20:36,945 --> 00:20:37,987
Here's yours, baldy.

453
00:20:39,989 --> 00:20:42,075
[chuckles delightedly]

454
00:20:42,158 --> 00:20:43,159
Uh.

455
00:20:43,743 --> 00:20:45,120
Wait, this is my axe.

456
00:20:45,203 --> 00:20:47,497
You really fixed it!
It's got a new skill too!

457
00:20:47,580 --> 00:20:49,416
That oughta put some hair back
on your dome.

458
00:20:49,499 --> 00:20:51,042
If I appraise
a piece of equipment,

459
00:20:51,126 --> 00:20:52,669
I can reveal its hidden skill!

460
00:20:52,752 --> 00:20:55,338
That's broken as hell,
and I frickin' love it!

461
00:20:55,422 --> 00:20:57,048
Let me try.
Can you appraise mine too?

462
00:20:57,632 --> 00:21:00,135
I guess I'll give you a deal
and just charge you 30 gold.

463
00:21:00,510 --> 00:21:02,721
Sometimes the gear
doesn't have hidden skills,

464
00:21:02,804 --> 00:21:04,597
but if it does,
you owe me another 300--

465
00:21:04,681 --> 00:21:05,640
[FAKER] Do mine next!

466
00:21:05,724 --> 00:21:07,183
[LAELLA] Can you please
appraise mine too?

467
00:21:07,267 --> 00:21:08,268
[ZEDNOS]
Yeah, take a look at mine too!

468
00:21:08,351 --> 00:21:10,562
No! Somebody!
Get these beggars out of here!

469
00:21:11,271 --> 00:21:12,814
-We'll fight for it.
-Rock, paper, scissors.

470
00:21:12,897 --> 00:21:14,274
No, we should draw lots.

471
00:21:14,357 --> 00:21:16,317
Nah! Do ghost leg instead!

472
00:21:16,401 --> 00:21:17,777
[all chattering]

473
00:21:17,861 --> 00:21:20,280
[TAKUMI] <i>Golly.</i>
<i>They are super loud.</i>

474
00:21:20,864 --> 00:21:22,490
<i>It's like</i>
<i>they're friends IRL too.</i>

475
00:21:23,867 --> 00:21:24,826
[JISHUKA] Believe it or not,

476
00:21:24,909 --> 00:21:26,953
we've been struggling
a lot lately.

477
00:21:27,037 --> 00:21:29,706
But now, everyone
has a new lease on life.

478
00:21:29,998 --> 00:21:30,957
All thanks to you.

479
00:21:31,041 --> 00:21:32,250
You don't say.

480
00:21:32,334 --> 00:21:35,045
[JISHUKA] The ability
to create valuable items

481
00:21:35,420 --> 00:21:38,131
strong enough
to defeat High Priest Malaxus...

482
00:21:38,506 --> 00:21:40,800
Grid, tell me the truth.

483
00:21:40,884 --> 00:21:42,677
You have a legendary job, right?

484
00:21:43,762 --> 00:21:45,055
[TAKUMI] <i>She figured it out?</i>

485
00:21:45,138 --> 00:21:46,681
<i>I mean, I didn't expect</i>
<i>to keep it a secret</i>

486
00:21:46,765 --> 00:21:47,682
<i>for very long, but--</i>

487
00:21:47,766 --> 00:21:50,935
<i>God damn, why does she look</i>
<i>so sexy right now?!</i>

488
00:21:52,312 --> 00:21:53,897
Uh, maybe.

489
00:21:54,481 --> 00:21:55,607
[squeals]

490
00:21:55,690 --> 00:21:58,068
Oh, I'm so happy
that you joined our guild!

491
00:21:58,151 --> 00:22:01,112
[TAKUMI] <i>Sure, real life blows.</i>

492
00:22:01,196 --> 00:22:03,490
